{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はリクエストアワー2012に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出させて頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB48さんのステージに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"立たせて頂き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に有り難うございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達は デビュー曲である"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ぐるぐるカーテン』を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてお客様の前で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"披露しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46にとって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい経験になった一日でした。."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達,乃木坂46が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB48さんの場に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一発目に出る事。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい不安でいっぱいでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は,"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ブーイングがおこるだろうな』とメンバーみんなが思ってたはずです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は,"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","